  "notes": "USAGE:\nFunctions as a noun and suru-verb ({献金|けんきん}する). Most commonly encountered in political contexts. {政治|せいじ}{献金|けんきん} (political donations) is a common news topic in Japan. Also used for religious offerings, though {寄付|きふ} (donation) is the more general term for charitable giving.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {政治|せいじ}{献金|けんきん}: political donation\n- {違法|いほう}{献金|けんきん}: illegal donation\n- {企業|きぎょう}{献金|けんきん}: corporate donation\n- {献金|けんきん}を{受|う}ける: to receive a donation\n- {献金|けんきん}{問題|もんだい}: donation scandal",
